{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Moves legacy source patch journals (<ctlid>_patches records inside a library) into this instance's local runtime journal, through dev.code.patch_journal's verified migrate path. Select one/all libraries and controls (empty or * = all); limit bounds journals processed (0 unlimited); dry_run reports entries and bytes without writing. Each journal is imported entry by entry, read back and compared, and only then is the legacy record deleted via secured app.delete - in a git-tracked library that shows up as a deleted file to commit. Nothing is written to control records; the runtime journal id is derived from library + control id. Safe to re-run: already-converted journals report already_migrated, and entries an older binary appended to a legacy record after its import are carried over. Returns per-journal results and counts {candidates, converted, entries, skipped, failed}.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;","params":[{"desc":"One source library, or empty/* for every library with a controls index","name":"lib","type":"String"},{"desc":"One control name/id, or empty/* for every control in the selected libraries","name":"ctl","type":"String"},{"desc":"Stop after this many migrated journals; 0 means no limit","name":"limit","type":"Integer"},{"desc":"Report candidate journals without creating or deleting records","name":"dry_run","type":"Boolean"},{"desc":"Calling session, used to authorize removal of verified legacy journals","name":"nn_sessionid","type":"String"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"wtturu1a1c1872c7av89","readers":[],"time":1794317834961,"username":"system","writers":[]}